> For the month of April only: Receive Dermapen 4 Face & Neck Treatment + An Alginate Mask + IonZyme Machine Treatment for only R1,500 (all inclusive).
We are proud to launch the new Dermapen 4 at[ Natural] Aesthetics. We were the first clinic in South Africa to receive the Dermapen 4. So what makes the D[erm]ap[en 4] so much better than the[ D]ermap[en] 3 or[ any] other microneed[ling] device?
Dermap[en 4 has] a 16 needle cartridge[ instead of just 12] needles, reaching an inflammatory response at a much quicker rate.
The Dermap[en 4] generates 47.9% more micro-channels than[ Derm]ap[en] 3[ and 104% more] micro-ch[annels] than[ any] counterfeit device.
The Dermap[en 4 generates] 1,920 puncture channels per second[, which] means we can almost double the[ amount] of serums and actives[ that] we needle into the skin per treatment, than before.
The[ additional] 620 micro-channels makes the[ treatment] much quicker and more comfortable than before.
Dermap[en 4] is the only microneed[ling] device with a dedicated scar setting and protocols for revision of deep, atrophic scars; including surgical, burn contracture, striae and post-acne scars. Needle penetration can now be increased up to 3.0mm[.]
AOVN technology, automatically calibrates the motor speed, pressure and penetration for targeted precision.
The Dermap[en] 4 is safer than[ other] microneedling devices, no dragging or pulling of the skin.
Only Dermap[en] 4 features a unique, medical-grade silicone seal and fluid guard. The external cartridge is fortified with a specialised fluid guard that prevents cross contamination to the outer cartridge shell. Safety First!
Specialised retention valves relieve the build-up of procedural pressure within the D[erm]ap[en] 4 needle cartridge. The[ effect] prevents fluid build-up within the needle cavity. The[ vacuum]-like sensation removes the risk of cross contamination whilst ensuring[ pressure]-free contact to the skin during a procedure.
