Among the highlights of the[ Sap]atos Festival will be the shoe bazaar that will run from November[ 12] to[ January] 6 at the[ Freedom] Park,[ right] across the Marikina City Hall.
Over 50 manufacturers from Marikina will be selling their products – shoes, bags, belts, wallets, and other accessories at attractive prices[.]
